                                                    "patching_rect": [ 243.0, 31.0, 630.0, 169.0 ],
                                                    "text": "The goal is to save individual matrix states as nested dictionaries within \"TSP-Matrix-States\". \nEach state has its number ID as key and another dictionary as value. This dictionary contains connection gains in the following form:\n- KEY: from-to as a symbol (es \"3 0\" is connection from input 3 to output 0).\n- VALUE: gain of connection for that state.\n\nThe \"TSP-connection-map\" dictionary is used to keep track of where the connection gains are coming from: either inference or direct mapping. This can be edited from the connection manager section.",
                                                    "textcolor": [ 1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0 ]
                                                }
