                                                                    "id": "obj-3",
                                                                    "linecount": 8,
                                                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                                                    "patching_rect": [ 246.5, 100.0, 521.0, 169.0 ],
                                                                    "text": "Instead, we keep track of all the connections that have a direct mapping applied. Everytime a direct connection is made, we add it to this coll, where the index is the index of the modulator (1-10) and the values are connection ID (from-to) and connection gain. When a featyre that is already in use is mapped to another connection gain, another pair of ID and gain is appended to its index entrance. \nThis way we can use the feature ID to lookup the coll and send it with the correct gain to all the connections its mapped to.\n",
                                                                    "textcolor": [ 1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0 ]
                                                                }
                                                            },
                                                            {
                                                                "box": {
                                                                    "fontface": 1,
                                                                    "fontname": "Ableton Sans Medium",
                                                                    "fontsize": 15.0,
                                                                    "id": "obj-2",
                                                                    "linecount": 3,
                                                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                                                    "patching_rect": [ 248.0, 35.0, 521.0, 61.0 ],
                                                                    "text": "A motion feature can be mapped to multiple connection gains. Since we have 56 independent connections, we don't want to route with a matrix where we have the features as input and every single connection as output.",
                                                                    "textcolor": [ 1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0 ]
                                                                }
                                                            },
                                                            {
                                                                "box": {
