                                            {
                                                "box": {
                                                    "fontface": 1,
                                                    "fontname": "Ableton Sans Medium",
                                                    "fontsize": 15.0,
                                                    "id": "obj-43",
                                                    "linecount": 16,
                                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                                    "patching_rect": [ 534.0, 234.0, 603.0, 295.0 ],
                                                    "text": "- The dict stores only the active mappings. The key is the connection ID as a symbol, and the value is 1 for Inference and 2 for Direct. If direct, the value is an array containing also the motion feature and the connection gain (set through in 4 and 5).\n\n- In 1 and 2: In/Out selector. As soon as a connection is selected, the dict is lookup to see if it's present (first \"contains\" message to avoid errors from getting unexisting keys).\nIf it is, the values are output to the GUIs to display.\n\n- In 3: Mapping type. Can be \"None\" (no mapping), Inference (use NN, only if in training set) and Direct. \n\n- In 4: What motion feature to use for direct mapping. This menu is available only when the mapping selector is set to direct.\n\n- In 5: the connection gain. This menu is available only when the mapping selector is set to direct. It varies between -1. and 1.",
                                                    "textcolor": [ 1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0 ]
                                                }
