                                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                                    "patching_rect": [ 358.0, 222.0, 434.0, 151.0 ],
                                                    "text": "The speed is the derivative of the position. To avoid false velocity peaks when going from non-touching to a positive position and then back to zero, we use this gate mechanism. A few clarifications: \n- the gate is only for the value in the delta that triggers the operation, but the previous value is still updated so that the difference can be 0 in the next cycle.\n- For this to work, the position needs to be not smoothed.",
